\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces First export of infection in the clique--leaf network ($n=100$, $k=2$, $\beta =0.005$, 10\,000 runs of each model). (a) Empirical distribution functions of the export time. (b) Distributions of the difference $T_{\mathrm  {export}}-T_B$; negative values correspond to export before either real bridge node becomes infected. (c) Fraction of runs with this violation of the transmission order and 95\% confidence intervals. }}{11}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:clique_leaf}{{2}{11}{}{}{}}
